  "summary": "Head 77cf9179b3 only merges main (empty diff on all transcribe files); the still-open BLOCKING thread 6/11 reproduces unchanged on this head: require: word with default empty granularities silently succeeds without words or warnings, violating AC5/Q4. Gates green on the unchanged tree (analyze clean, 76/76 targeted suites).",
