This head merges `main` again (plugin session-records plumbing in `agent_cli.dart`, which lands next to — and does not disturb — the PR's `transcribeSessionId` wiring, still intact at `agent_cli.dart:559`). The transcribe ladder files are untouched, so the gap from threads 6/11/12 is unchanged at line 645:

```dart
